        "| Explanation of the code holds up | 5 |\n",
        "\n",
        "### Part 5 — The Verdict (10 pts)\n",
        "\n",
        "| Criteria | Points |\n",
        "|-----------------------------------------|:-----------------------------:|\n",
        "| Specific, well-reasoned answers grounded in the student's own results | 10 |\n",
        "\n",
        "### Part 6 — Reflection & AI Disclosure (15 pts)\n",
        "\n",
